      "navigation": "Creator Library opens Spatial Studio; assistance overlays the scene; closing and returning restores the ordinary Creator Library.",
      "designTarget": "Preserve the blue workstation and Room feature selector. Add room features creates explicitly generic placeholders. Classification edits labels; Rebuild changes the actual model while retaining the chosen name, footprint and pose. Remove and Rebuild reject attached supports with recovery guidance; the whole floor stays singular. A known feature width/height/depth uniformly scales approximate room geometry, keeps only that reference measured, and preserves clue sizes and normal history/save. Results must be observable in the actual renderer and correction fields must remain accessible on phone.",
